{"shots": [{"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "2026", "scene": "hook", "vo": "How one man *fooled all the greens*."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Social media", "scene": "panic", "vo": "2026. Social media panics: AI will *drink all the fresh water* on the planet. Eco-activists sound the alarm."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "App Store", "scene": "app", "vo": "Then comes *EcoGPT* — a “green” chatbot that promises to *save the Earth*."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Promises", "scene": "promise", "vo": "It runs on *clean energy*. For every hundred questions, it plants a *real tree*."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Money", "scene": "money", "vo": "Subscription: *ten dollars*, half the price of ChatGPT. *A million downloads*. The money flows.", "card": "money"}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Newsroom", "scene": "nda", "vo": "But journalists asked one question: which AI models does it run on? The answer: first, sign a *non-disclosure agreement*."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Finland", "scene": "servers", "vo": "So they dug in themselves. The servers are *perfectly ordinary*, rented from Google in Finland. How much energy the bot uses — *impossible to check*."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Reviews", "scene": "scam", "vo": "And in the reviews, one word keeps coming up: *scam*."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Africa", "scene": "trees", "vo": "The trees are real — they are planted in *Africa*. But experts say: the more you chat with the bot, the more *energy* it burns. And a tree takes *decades* to absorb that carbon."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Verdict", "scene": "wow", "vo": "The eco numbers? The company promises them… *“soon”*."}, {"badge": "INVESTIGATION", "loc": "Verdict", "scene": "end", "vo": "Saving the planet — or a *scam built on fear*? Tell us in the comments."}], "meta": [{"dur": 2.1535, "phr": [[0, 2.1535, "How one man *fooled all the greens*."]]}, {"dur": 8.891833333333333, "phr": [[0, 1.49, "2026."], 